      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58885c81d3e0765c87d64bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我会在“有马纪念”上迎战，超越她──\n向你证明我的话是正确的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3cd662ed1d8f1ae7b56f3187d5804f5c66bad26b381f8e7801ce8722fb3d57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a6ba8b116f234bf3de36366",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5428e4cebfca883726cbcb80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以你不必再做任何事了，\n我会处理好这一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91f4655897d631c12529a162547176e8522718be341fe295909919b43abf0ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbac2492d4ff1f47a685f112",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我并没有完全相信她，\n就连现在，她这番话听起来\n也像在拼命说服自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddd8b464b6532b2f651049db2b15fb69d3a900c1b08502d8eba6a7cfc25a4006",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ae6d7eac2df06ff1612f11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我知道了",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c2250d7e1fdcdf10f6797017c6148a40c441be3806eaacce9db93da844abe0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd1269dd811d5cc0f76e4c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而就算是这样，她还是想\n以自己的方式向前迈进。既然如此──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bffb165c052b09816a732105d4567883615691f1fae39b8ccb3129f1bfbe805d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59916bf9206e2a5e3acc1f12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从现在开始，我会静静地守护并支持着她。\n接下来是“有马纪念”，\n就要和鲁道夫象征对决了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04c6600401d3c8b270ba620d363bb017282d9d59cc34c2dce0499584283e65cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0065445c12e49dda838c2d37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "令人深刻感觉到她展现出的锐利，\n就像是想撕裂某种东西一样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "76c8b5b394dc896063a4a736aff354d5cb565600f9b36ec0e8b227bc3a630641",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c179a4523045bc4505bfe8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "直到比赛结束后，\n她锐利的目光都不曾消失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27503dba5dc372ee49c43937eca58c14e333e05e962ebf5be2b427c43ecbc8b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
