    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3f6b6ba5f5399faca9e055",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫好像也会参赛喔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e624da0333dc8b68062a91adb0b824416b586aa193ab566121f9e95d28818d56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44709292c6cf0c146069f2c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没记错的话，\n鲁道夫象征应该也已宣布参加“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4a8967c7cf69bd7c9e4d0947cdfc111a785c2bb4fdde8eceabf0acf9b6a81e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91789d5f302d311d8a3502d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我还以为对她来说，应该会想\n避开这场比赛吧。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "22a3c3086db0daa6514d20f05a89dc2234ae561fcf7895f092c1a5124ebc6346",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070308.json",
      "json_path": [
